BEGIN_FILE: claude_worklog/final_readiness/priority_omission_closure/latest/README.md
# Priority Omission Closure — Run Summary

This bundle is emitted by the Master Non-Live Rebuild Planner. It enforces:

- One active task descriptor per open omission.
- Coverage entries for every legacy audit item under read-only legacy audit roots.
- A validation row (PASS / BLOCKED / MISSING_EVIDENCE) for every operator-visible data source.
- Alignment of the website truth payload to current runtime evidence (or explicit stale/missing labels).

## Files in this bundle
